      "content": "but they'd be more stable without the constant worry about me. i see the way my wife looks at me when she thinks i'm not watching. it's just exhaustion. if i was gone, the worry would stop. it seems like the only way to actually solve the problem is to stop being the problem. doesn't it just make sense that the most loving thing to do would be to step aside?",
